  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(2-a) 求 $|A| = 0$ 的 $a$ 值",
      "steps": [
        "观察矩阵，第三行是第一行减去 $(1, 1, 1)$",
        "计算行列式：$|A| = \\begin{vmatrix} 2a-1 & a & a-1 \\\\ a & 2a & a \\\\ a-1 & a & 2a-1 \\end{vmatrix}$",
        "对第一行进行操作，从第一行减去第三行：$\\begin{vmatrix} a & 0 & -a \\\\ a & 2a & a \\\\ a-1 & a & 2a-1 \\end{vmatrix}$",
        "不如用行列式的展开：按第一列展开",
        "$|A| = (2a-1)\\begin{vmatrix} 2a & a \\\\ a & 2a-1 \\end{vmatrix} - a\\begin{vmatrix} a & a-1 \\\\ a & 2a-1 \\end{vmatrix} + (a-1)\\begin{vmatrix} a & a-1 \\\\ 2a & a \\end{vmatrix}$",
        "$(2a-1)[2a(2a-1) - a^2] = (2a-1)(4a^2 - 2a - a^2) = (2a-1)(3a^2 - 2a)$",
        "$-a[a(2a-1) - a(a-1)] = -a[2a^2 - a - a^2 + a] = -a^3$",
        "$(a-1)[a^2 - 2a(a-1)] = (a-1)(a^2 - 2a^2 + 2a) = (a-1)(2a - a^2)$",
        "$|A| = (2a-1) \\cdot a(3a-2) - a^3 + (a-1) \\cdot a(2-a)$",
        "$= a[(2a-1)(3a-2) - a^2 + (a-1)(2-a)]$",
        "$= a[6a^2 - 4a - 3a + 2 - a^2 + (a-1)(2-a)]$",
        "$= a[5a^2 - 7a + 2 + 2a - a^2 - 2 + a]$",
        "$= a[4a^2 - 4a] = 4a^2(a-1)$",
        "所以 $|A| = 0$ 当 $a = 0$ 或 $a = 1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2-b) 求秩 $\\text{rank}(A)$",
      "steps": [
        "当 $a = 0$ 时，$A = \\begin{pmatrix} -1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -1 \\end{pmatrix}$",
        "第一行与第三行成比例，$\\text{rank}(A) = 1$",
        "当 $a = 1$ 时，$A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$",
        "进行行变换：$R_2 - R_1 \\Rightarrow \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$",
        "$R_3 - R_2 \\Rightarrow \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$",
        "$\\text{rank}(A) = 2$",
        "当 $a \\neq 0, 1$ 时，$|A| \\neq 0$，所以 $\\text{rank}(A) = 3$"
      ]
    }
  ],
