        "根据行列式的值判断秩"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "matrix_rank_det",
        "template": "求矩阵 $D$ 的行列式与秩",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "行列式与秩",
          "steps": [
            "$|D| = 1 \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} - 1 \\cdot \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} + 0$",
            "$= 1(1-1) - 1(1-0) = 0 - 1 = -1$",
            "由于 $|D| = -1 \\neq 0$，所以 $\\text{rank}(D) = 3$"
          ]
        }
      ],
